# SECURITY — XSS, CSP, third-party network
File: website/audit/security.oot

Verdict: PASS. Live home is static HTML. The SPA markdown
renderer is gone, so pulled `.oot` cannot inject HTML.
Refreshed 2026-09-15: no `src/*.js`, no collect form.

## 1. HTML injection

There is no markdown renderer and no `#content` fetch.
Home copy is hand-written HTML in `index.html`.
`404.html` is static. Residual JS is `js/copy.js`,
`js/rotate.js`, `js/panels.js`. Copy uses known strings;
it does not interpolate the URL hash into HTML.

## 2. Content-Security-Policy

Neither `index.html` nor `404.html` sets a CSP meta tag.
Home links `styles/*.css` and `js/*.js` from this origin.
A Cloudflare insights beacon is a third-party script.

## 3. Email collect

The collect.openooda.org join form is gone from home.
Do not restore it in this pass.

## 4. install.sh pipe to bash

`website/install.sh` curls install-repo `install.sh` and pipes
to bash. Keep the URL. Do not add more shell.

## 5. Reduced motion

`js/rotate.js` skips the typewriter under
`prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`. No sky canvas. No dogfight.

## 6. Next repair

Optional: CSP for the Cloudflare beacon and local scripts.
Not this pass.
